1.3-0.9003 (2026-10-01)
-----
Fixed error variance in the Gibbs update of betanonART: it is now (omega*loessSD)^2
as in the model, instead of omega^2*loessSD.

Speed-up of e0hiv.predict: trajectories of a country are generated for all samples 
at once (requires bayesLife >= 5.3-2.9002). Results are unchanged for a given seed.

Fixed a bug in defining countries with HIV.

Changed how trajectories are aligned with the HIV trajectories.

Speed-up of MCMC: the betanonART update no longer builds diagonal matrices of the size 
of the data. loess.lookup.hiv vectorized. Results are unchanged for a given seed.

Adapted MCMC to bayesLife >= 5.3-2.9001, where country-specific parameters 
and omega are updated from pre-computed data (cs.data). The HIV-adjusted 
data are now passed to the sampler in every iteration.

Added a unit test checking that the sampler uses the HIV-adjusted data.

1.3-0 (2025-06-25)
-----
Added documentation and unit tests.

1.2-0 (2025-06-19)
-----
Annual HIV data updated to datasets used in WPP 2024. 

1.1-0 (2024-03-24)
-----
Fixed loess for countries with e0 < 15.

Option for annual simulation added. 

Default wpp.year changed to 2019.

1.0-0 (2019-06-17)
